+$NetBSD$
+
+Use the real immutable NetBSD C locale for generic numeric conversion.
+Keep the generic int* locale ABI, stream grammar, overflow and errno handling;
+other platforms retain the original generic backend. No process setlocale.
+Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted); not submitted upstream.
